      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most playful piece this week is this adorable oversized rabbit bag, designed by LV’s menswear creative director Pharrell Williams. Crafted from plush shearling lambskin, its fur is smooth and fluffy with a luxuriously soft touch, making it look lifelike. The rabbit’s body cleverly conceals a zippered opening, lined in calfskin, and features a top handle and detachable shoulder strap—perfect for carrying your very own pet!",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
